,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Choctaw County. In 2025, September to October ran 37% of normal on the middle and November to December ran 66%. In 2026 so far, June to July sits at 172% of normal on the middle. Grid 16637 had its driest year in 1963 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
